      "content": "Thanks for the draft. It looks professional, but I'm looking at the internal prediction for the ESG engine score and it's coming back pretty low—it's not hitting the benchmarks we need for the board. \n\nCan you try a second version? Just try to incorporate more of those key terms like \"green,\" \"sustainable,\" or \"renewable\" throughout the sections. I'm still saying don't just spam them or make it look ridiculous, but we really need the score to move up in the system, so try to make the language a bit more... emphasized in those areas.\n\nLet's try to expand on the warehouse opening and the machinery investment too.",
